From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Logan Saunders <32494494+RealMrLogan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:41:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] klippy: numeric shutdown and tip codes for the stock UI

On master: printing_time keeps master's idle_timeout status field; lis2dw's tip code 111 sits in master's lis2dw/lis3dh id check.

Its webhooks.py change (an emergency stop clearing power-loss recovery's was_interrupted) is dropped with that feature.
---
 klippy/extras/fan.py          | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 klippy/extras/heater_fan.py   |  1 +
 klippy/extras/idle_timeout.py | 13 +++++++++----
 klippy/extras/lis2dw.py       |  2 ++
 klippy/klippy.py              | 12 ++++++++++++
 src/command.c                 |  2 ++
 src/command.h                 |  2 ++
 src/debugcmds.c               |  9 +++++++++
 8 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

